    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-orchestration:app:narrative:example-example-meta-orchestration-infer-run-plan:infer-and-review-a-run-plan" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-orchestration:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-orchestration:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metaorchestration">
      <Body>Create orchestration from a modeled pipeline, then review the issues and plan.

Creation derives the provable part of the run graph. Any remaining ordering or lock decision is visible in the orchestration workspace before execution.

```powershell
meta-orchestration create --pipeline-workspace .\Pipeline.Workspace --output-xml .\Orchestration.Workspace
meta-orchestration list-issues --workspace .\Orchestration.Workspace
meta-orchestration refresh-run-plan --workspace .\Orchestration.Workspace
meta-orchestration inspect-run-plan --workspace .\Orchestration.Workspace
```</Body>
      <LastReviewedImportBatchId></LastReviewedImportBatchId>
